---
description: Sanity CMS integration
alwaysApply: false
---
- Only /lib and /sanity may import the Sanity client.
- GROQ queries always alias slug: `"slug": slug.current`, so the returned shape matches /types.
- Use `next/image` with Sanity image URLs via @sanity/image-url.
- Keep the Sanity token and project ID in .env.local; never hardcode or commit them.
- Use ISR (`revalidate`) or on-demand revalidation instead of fetching on every request.
